    "detailed_description": "Relive the arcade era!  Select from 8 unique characters and brawl your way to victory in Neon Krieger Yamato - solo or with a friend!  A genre mashup of Japanese 90s gaming, its goal is to capture a mix of stylish combos, sidescrolling action, and twitch combat puzzles, presented in a pixel art cyberpunk world harkening to the days of 16 bit.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785460/extras/083f051968daa8aefce6d3c8011999f6.avif?t=1674593312\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785460/extras/3d52254b2446edccc407b7ad85fde217.avif?t=1674593312\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785460/extras/b0c5aff505fd20486080a9aa93a45dfc.poster.avif?t=1674593312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785460/extras/b0c5aff505fd20486080a9aa93a45dfc.webm?t=1674593312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785460/extras/b0c5aff505fd20486080a9aa93a45dfc.mp4?t=1674593312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Different Characters, Different Playstyles</strong><br>Select your character for the playstyle you prefer!  Every character has their own moveset.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785460/extras/ac3e69863d8652e9ebd097522b678789.poster.avif?t=1674593312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785460/extras/ac3e69863d8652e9ebd097522b678789.webm?t=1674593312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785460/extras/ac3e69863d8652e9ebd097522b678789.mp4?t=1674593312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Unleash Combos and Super Attacks</strong><br>Brawl your way to victory with gigantic combos and devastating super attacks!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785460/extras/7ea347b6825ca420b0c219283d161b83.poster.avif?t=1674593312\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785460/extras/7ea347b6825ca420b0c219283d161b83.webm?t=1674593312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785460/extras/7ea347b6825ca420b0c219283d161b83.mp4?t=1674593312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Unique Stage Mechanics</strong><br>Every stage has unique mechanics making every level its own puzzle.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Single Player or Local Co-op<br></li><li>Sidescroller Mix of Brawler, Platformer, and Fighting Game Mechanics<br></li><li>8 Selectable Characters<br></li><li>Unique Playstyle and Movesets for each Character<br></li><li>Juggle Combo System<br></li><li>Time and Combo Attack Challenges<br></li><li>Epic Boss Battles<br></li><li>Handcrafted Pixel Art</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/785460/extras/7d662bbf98677038d3c957c2e1fc7577.avif?t=1674593312\" /></div>",
